        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Lures</strong> is an <strong>idle</strong> <strong>fishing sim</strong> that sits at the bottom of your screen. Play Little Lures at your own pace, it's a casual game you can play while you multitask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/extras/8c82ae49ed86cfc5b7f7e40417daaee6.avif?t=1779291645\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Spots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and manage fishing spots for your towns people to catch various types of fresh water and salt water fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Bait</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bait farms to collect bait for your towns people to fish.<strong> The Barn</strong> allows you to manage<strong> pigs</strong> that will automate your bait farms.<strong> The Chicken Coop</strong> allows you to manage<strong> chickens</strong> that will dig up bait around the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/extras/220c28f41ff8aee30d6f6fa51aac7e1d.avif?t=1779291645\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Lures</strong> is an <strong>idle</strong> <strong>fishing sim</strong> that sits at the bottom of your screen. Play Little Lures at your own pace, it's a casual game you can play while you multitask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/extras/8c82ae49ed86cfc5b7f7e40417daaee6.avif?t=1779291645\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Spots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and manage fishing spots for your towns people to catch various types of fresh water and salt water fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Bait</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bait farms to collect bait for your towns people to fish.<strong> The Barn</strong> allows you to manage<strong> pigs</strong> that will automate your bait farms.<strong> The Chicken Coop</strong> allows you to manage<strong> chickens</strong> that will dig up bait around the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900250/extras/220c28f41ff8aee30d6f6fa51aac7e1d.avif?t=1779291645\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
